BT /F2 11.5 Tf 0.10 0.15 0.25 rg 48.0 634.0 Td (1. Executive Overview & SaaS Problem Context) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.22 0.22 0.22 rg 48.0 620.0 Td (Generating executive reports is the most universal background job in modern software engineering. Every business-to-) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.22 0.22 0.22 rg 48.0 608.8 Td (business SaaS product ships this feature. However, naive implementations frequently crash production environments through) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.22 0.22 0.22 rg 48.0 597.6 Td (three fatal flaws: \(1\) passing 20 megabytes of raw PDF byte data through HTTP JSON responses, exhausting server memory) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.22 0.22 0.22 rg 48.0 586.4 Td (and ballooning client payloads; \(2\) hitting the classic page-break trap where multi-page tables are sliced in half across) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.22 0.22 0.22 rg 48.0 575.2 Td (text rows; and \(3\) loading thousands of database rows into application memory rather than leveraging database engine) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.22 0.22 0.22 rg 48.0 564.0 Td (aggregations. This project designs and implements a robust, enterprise-grade FastAPI pipeline that completely overcomes) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.22 0.22 0.22 rg 48.0 552.8 Td (these failure modes using pure SQL aggregation, deterministic artifact storage, strict idempotency, and asynchronous) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.22 0.22 0.22 rg 48.0 541.6 Td (Inngest durable job orchestration.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.5 Tf 0.10 0.15 0.25 rg 48.0 520.4 Td (2. The Five Production Architectural Tenets) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.5 Tf 0.12 0.31 0.58 rg 48.0 506.4 Td (- Tenet 1: Never Pass 20 MB of File Bytes in JSON \(Store & Link Pattern\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.25 rg 58.0 495.4 Td (HTTP endpoints should never serialize binary documents into JSON bodies. Doing so causes 33% base64 encoding bloat and CPU) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.25 rg 58.0 484.9 Td (lockups. Instead, POST /reports reserves an ID, generates the PDF to reports/<id>.pdf on disk, and returns a 201 Created) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.25 rg 58.0 474.4 Td (metadata response containing the download URL \(/reports/<id>/file\). The dedicated file route streams binary application/pdf) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.25 rg 58.0 463.9 Td (independently.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.5 Tf 0.12 0.31 0.58 rg 48.0 449.4 Td (- Tenet 2: Defeat the Page-Break Trap with Pure Print CSS) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.25 rg 58.0 438.4 Td (When HTML is converted into multi-page PDFs, tables routinely split across page cuts, cutting text characters horizontally in) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.25 rg 58.0 427.9 Td (half and leaving subsequent pages with orphaned data columns. Our pipeline injects strict print CSS rules: 'tr { page-break-) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.25 rg 58.0 417.4 Td (inside: avoid; }' forces rows to remain atomic, while 'thead { display: table-header-group; }' automatically repeats table) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.25 rg 58.0 406.9 Td (headers on all 7 pages.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.5 Tf 0.12 0.31 0.58 rg 48.0 392.4 Td (- Tenet 3: Push Aggregations Down into the Database Engine) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.25 rg 58.0 381.4 Td (Application code should never pull 500,000 raw rows into Python memory to compute sums or find top products. The pipeline) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.25 rg 58.0 370.9 Td (delegates all math to SQLite via COUNT\(*\), SUM\(amount\), substr\(created_at, 1, 10\), and GROUP BY ... ORDER BY ... LIMIT 5) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.25 rg 58.0 360.4 Td (queries, executing in sub-milliseconds.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.5 Tf 0.12 0.31 0.58 rg 48.0 345.9 Td (- Tenet 4: Strict Idempotency \('Ask Twice, Get One'\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.25 rg 58.0 334.9 Td (Rapid double-clicks, webhook retries, or impatient users must never trigger redundant CPU-intensive rendering or duplicate) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.25 rg 58.0 324.4 Td (disk artifacts. A second POST /reports on the same day detects the existing generation and returns 200 OK with the existing) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.25 rg 58.0 313.9 Td (report link. Clients who genuinely require fresh regeneration must explicitly pass {'force': true}.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.5 Tf 0.12 0.31 0.58 rg 48.0 299.4 Td (- Tenet 5: Asynchronous Background Orchestration \(The A7 Pattern\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.25 rg 58.0 288.4 Td (For heavyweight workloads, synchronous HTTP requests risk hitting load balancer gateway timeouts \(e.g. AWS ALB 30s timeout\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.25 rg 58.0 277.9 Td (The async route POST /reports/async returns 202 Accepted immediately with status 'pending' and dispatches a durable event to) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.25 rg 58.0 267.4 Td (Inngest. Clients poll GET /reports/<id> until the background worker transitions status to 'done'.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.25 rg 48.0 42.0 Td (FlyRank Backend AI Engineering  -  BE-08 Submission  -  Jezreal Momoh) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.25 rg 509.0 42.0 Td (Page 1 of 4) Tj ET
